id: low-dilution
name: Low Dilution
order: 1
optionOf: traces-of-majin
description: >
  Low Dilution [Triggered, 1/Round]: If you take Damage from an Attacking Maneuver, regain Life Points equal to your Surgency.
text: >
  Low Dilution [Triggered, 1/Round]: If you take Damage from an Attacking Maneuver, regain Life Points equal to your Surgency.

---

# Damage from an Opponent's attack, once a Round. Automatic by default, its Triggered/Automatic button.
[triggered/opponent-damage, 1/round, effect 5]
life.value += surgency;
